# Candid interview material. Not published (Jekyll skips leading-underscore dirs),
# but this repo is public, so it stays local. Master audio + transcript live in
# ~/Documents/namba-audio/, deliberately outside the working tree.
_docs/namba-background.md
*.m4a
# Contact sheets are regenerable binaries; the .yml manifests beside them are kept.
# The glob must be *-contact*.jpg, not *-contact.jpg: --preview writes paged sheets
# named -contact-01.jpg upwards, which the narrower pattern silently let through.
_docs/story-manifests/*-contact*.jpg
assets/images/_triage/
.playwright-mcp/
node_modules/
.lighthouse/
__pycache__/
# Source video for the Whip Off story. 58.5MB of HEVC at 14.3 Mbps, which is far more
# than the 720x1280 needs and would sit in git history permanently, where a later
# re-encode cannot remove it. Kept locally, out of the repo. If a video ships, transcode
# to H.264 at a sane bitrate first and then decide deliberately whether to commit it or
# host it off-repo; delete this rule at that point rather than working around it.
assets/video/
